{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Safe Spelunking plunges players into a series of increasingly perilous cave systems, each boasting distinct &amp; visually striking biomes. Beginning at the Base Camp, the player can prepare for descent &amp; select levels by navigating through thematic cavern entrances. Every run is procedurally generated, creating a new experience every time you punch in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHAOTIC COMBAT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap out between weapons in the base camp and battle long forgotten employees. Collect health and resources to defeat bosses. Don\u2019t forget about the traps, or they might blow up in your face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094230/extras/a7f1c7ef280fda72235c43a7f15109a7.poster.avif?t=1760591390\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094230/extras/a7f1c7ef280fda72235c43a7f15109a7.webm?t=1760591390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094230/extras/a7f1c7ef280fda72235c43a7f15109a7.mp4?t=1760591390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094230/extras/1ebcdf021a8a62c24b8645a79e5e0793.poster.avif?t=1760591390\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094230/extras/1ebcdf021a8a62c24b8645a79e5e0793.webm?t=1760591390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094230/extras/1ebcdf021a8a62c24b8645a79e5e0793.mp4?t=1760591390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></